<title>JAPAN: Rheinland Pfalz launches 3.1 pct reverse samurai.</title>
<headline>Rheinland Pfalz launches 3.1 pct reverse samurai.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following reverse yen/Australian dollar samurai bond issue was announced by lead manager Nikko Securities on Thursday: BORROWER Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz AMT 10 bln yen COUPON 3.10 pct ISS PRICE 100.05 MATURITY 22 May 2007 PAY DATE 22 May 1997 SUB PERIOD May 14 (scheduled)  PAY FREQ	  Annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P AA+, Moody's Aa1</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Long-Term Credit Bank of Japan</p>
<p>NOTE: The exchange rate was fixed at A$5,042.86 per 500,000 yen.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
